# Egress supervisor secrets (TEMPLATE, committed as names only).
# Real values go in tools/egress/.env (same file, NEVER committed — gitignored).
#
# - EGRESS_SUB_URL ... single v2ray subscription (legacy; kept working).
# - EGRESS_SUB_URLS .. MULTIPLE subscriptions, one per line (commas are
#   legal inside URLs and never split). Both vars merge; order preserved,
#   duplicates dropped.
#   Probe ranking: python tools/egress/supervisor.py --probe
# - EGRESS_SUP_TOKEN . Bearer token for the loopback API. Generate one with:
#     python tools/egress/supervisor.py --gen-token
#   then paste it here AND export EGRESS_SUP_TOKEN for clients.
#
# Phase 1 needs no tunnel: direct-mode leases (AvalAI/domestic targets)
# work with no VPN. Tunnels (xray children) arrive in phase 2.

EGRESS_SUB_URL=
EGRESS_SUB_URLS=
EGRESS_SUP_TOKEN=
